    "title": "Career Opportunity Teacher at Pune University International Enterprises",
    "description": "An exciting career opportunity awaits you at Pune University International Enterprises. We are on the lookout for a dedicated Teacher to strengthen our Noida-based team.\n\nAbout Pune University International Enterprises:\nPune University International Enterprises is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Design formative and summative assessments aligned to learning objectives\n• Participate in teacher training and professional development programs\n• Utilize technology and digital tools to enhance learning outcomes\n• Conduct doubt-clearing sessions and remedial classes for weak students\n• Collaborate with faculty on curriculum development initiatives\n• Create curriculum-aligned learning materials and assessments\n• Conduct parent-teacher meetings and update parents on student performance\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Master's degree preferred\n• 0-1 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Mentoring\n• Proficiency in Zoom/Teams\n• Proficiency in Curriculum Development\n• Proficiency in Educational Technology\n• Proficiency in Special Education\n• Proficiency in E-learning\n• Proficiency in Communication Skills\n• Proficiency in Classroom Management\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Flexible working hours\n• Salary Range: 2.5 LPA - 6 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Noida, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Pune University International Enterprises!",
